WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.128
Anthropology's big theories changed every

2
00:00:03.128 --> 00:00:04.328
few decades.

3
00:00:04.328 --> 00:00:05.934
Here's the arc.

4
00:00:06.258 --> 00:00:08.657
Morgan's Ancient Society,

5
00:00:08.657 --> 00:00:12.169
1877, ranked societies from savagery

6
00:00:12.169 --> 00:00:13.965
to civilisation.

7
00:00:13.965 --> 00:00:17.392
Functionalism followed in the 1920s.

8
00:00:17.392 --> 00:00:20.365
Lévi-Strauss's structuralism,

9
00:00:20.365 --> 00:00:21.994
from 1949.

10
00:00:22.337 --> 00:00:25.695
Malinowski: culture meets individual needs.

11
00:00:25.695 --> 00:00:28.567
Radcliffe-Brown: institutions keep the social

12
00:00:28.567 --> 00:00:29.903
structure going.

13
00:00:29.903 --> 00:00:33.287
Lévi-Strauss: culture reflects binary oppositions

14
00:00:33.287 --> 00:00:35.136
in the human mind.

15
00:00:35.464 --> 00:00:38.233
Boas's historical particularism,

16
00:00:38.233 --> 00:00:40.690
and Geertz's thick description.

17
00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:42.321
Your turn.

18
00:00:42.321 --> 00:00:43.792
Who wrote it?
